$- Pure import table for the C bootstrap VM.
   This file is inlined by the regenerator together with the pure module
   implementations. Every module object below comes from a pure Englishmen
   builder function, so the generated compiler source needs no native imports.
   The C bootstrap VM exposes its `host` module as a global object; the
   regenerator keeps that entry only for images built with that host present.
   All globals defined here are prefixed with `pi`. -$
